alerts.description:
Alerts are calculated internally from HI telemetry, worst-room detection, active target profiles, and CO readings. Humidity, mould, and condensation alerts resolve the affected room/sensor, map that room to a configured zone, and apply that zone's boost fan level. CO Emergency remains the highest-priority safety lane and uses configured CO telemetry plus existing configured ventilation outputs.

Configured visual indicator rules:
{configured_alerts}

alert_add.description:
Configure an optional visual indicator for an internally calculated HI alert. The selected alert source is calculated by HI, not by a custom trigger entity. Fan boost behavior is controlled by the affected room's mapped zone boost setting.

{advanced_note}

Advanced tuning contains CO threshold, power entity, flash mode, and duration.

alert_remove.description:
Remove an optional visual indicator rule. Internally calculated HI alert handling remains available even when no visual rule is configured.

